msgid "Hosting MkDocs sites on Read the Docs."
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上托管 MkDocs 站点。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:3
msgid "Deploying MkDocs on Read the Docs"
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上部署 MkDocs"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:8
msgid ""
"`MkDocs`_ is a fast, simple static site generator that's geared towards "
"building project documentation. MkDocs is written in Python, and supports "
"documentation written in Markdown. When using MkDocs, we recommend using the"
" `Material for MkDocs`_ theme, and this guide is mostly focused on the "
"integration required to make it work well on Read the Docs."
msgstr ""
"`MkDocs`_ 是一个快速、简单的静态站点生成器，专为构建项目文档而设计。MkDocs 使用 Python 编写，支持用 Markdown "
"编写文档。使用 MkDocs 时，我们推荐使用 `Material for MkDocs`_ 主题，本指南主要关注使其在 Read the Docs "
"上良好运行所需的集成配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:13
msgid ""
"Minimal configuration is required to build an existing MkDocs project on "
"Read the Docs:"
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上构建现有 MkDocs 项目所需的配置极少："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:15
msgid ".readthedocs.yaml"
msgstr ".readthedocs.yaml"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:38
msgid "Configuring Material for MkDocs on Read the Docs"
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上配置 Material for MkDocs"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:40
msgid ""
"In order to use the Material for MkDocs theme on Read the Docs, you need to "
"install and configure it. In your `mkdocs.yml` file, set the theme to "
"`material`:"
msgstr ""
"要在 Read the Docs 上使用 Material for MkDocs 主题，你需要安装并配置它。在你的 `mkdocs.yml` "
"文件中，将主题设置为 `material`："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:44
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:75
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:112
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:174
msgid "mkdocs.yml"
msgstr "mkdocs.yml"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:50
msgid ""
"With these changes, your MkDocs project will use the Material for MkDocs "
"theme when built on Read the Docs, and should work with the configuration "
"file shown above."
msgstr ""
"完成这些更改后，你的 MkDocs 项目在 Read the Docs 上构建时将使用 Material for MkDocs "
"主题，并应能与上述配置文件正常配合。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:54
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:56
msgid ""
"You can use our :ref:`MkDocs example project <examples:mkdocs>` as a "
"reference to create a new MkDocs project."
msgstr "你可以参考我们的 :ref:`MkDocs 示例项目 <examples:mkdocs>` 来创建新的 MkDocs 项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:57
msgid ""
"If you have an existing MkDocs project you want to host on Read the Docs, "
"check out our :doc:`/intro/add-project` guide."
msgstr "如果你已有想在 Read the Docs 上托管的 MkDocs 项目，请参阅 :doc:`/intro/add-project` 指南。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:58
