msgid ""
"There are some additional steps you can take to configure your MkDocs "
"project to work better with Read the Docs, and these apply to all MkDocs "
"projects."
msgstr "你还可以执行一些额外步骤来配置 MkDocs 项目，使其与 Read the Docs 更好地协作，这些步骤适用于所有 MkDocs 项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mkdocs.rst:67
